# Browsers Easy Docket supports.
#
# Ionic's default list reaches further back than Angular 22 does, which makes
# the build warn on every run. These are Angular's own supported baselines,
# which also happen to be the point at which the platform features this app
# depends on — WebCrypto on a secure origin, IndexedDB with compound indexes,
# CSS `color-scheme` — are reliably present.
#
# The Android WebView is covered by the Chrome query: Capacitor requires a
# System WebView well above this floor.

Chrome >=120
Firefox >=128
Edge >=120
Safari >=17
iOS >=17
